### Getting the profile before one even exists
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile

### Save a profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "heightIn" : 70, "sex": "MALE"}

### Reading the profile back
GET http://localhost:8080/api/profile

### Updating profile
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "heightIn" : 71, "sex": "MALE"}

### Testing Invalid height
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{ "heightIn" : -10, "sex": "MALE"}